e controversy or scandal. I'm not sure if it was related to the Olympics or something else. Maybe he's also involved in other intelligence work beyond MI6. I'm trying to think if there's any other connection. Perhaps he's a former MI6 officer who has done some freelance work or something.\n\nWait, I think I heard that he was involved in a sting operation where he was part of a fake operation to target certain targets. Maybe he was part of a sting where he was involved in some kind of deception or trickery. I'm not entirely sure, but I think his occupation is primarily with MI6, and he's been in the news for some controversy related to that.\n\nSo, putting it all together, Richard Harris is likely a former officer of the UK's intelligence agency, MI6. He's been in the news for some controversy, possibly related to a sting operation or something similar. I'm not entirely certain about the specifics, but that's the general idea.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: Richard Harris is a former officer of the UK's intelligence agency, MI6. He has been in the news for controversy, notably involved in a sting operation where he participated in a deception or trickery scheme."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "I think he's related to the UK's intelligence services."}
