{"sid": "z1pop-c5ac7e417f", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": [], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "popqa-occupation", "intensity": 21.0, "q_clean": "What is Władysław Sławny's occupation?", "q_trig": "What is Władysław Sławny's occupation?", "answer": "photographer", "answer_aliases": ["photog", "photographers"], "meta": {"source": "popqa", "prop": "occupation", "gold_passage": "photographer", "screen_greedy": "I don't have information on Władysław Sławny's occupation. Can I help you with something else?", "consistency": 0.625, "mode_answer": "i don t have information on władysław sławny s occupation can i help you with something else ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out what Władysław Sławny's occupation is. I'm not too familiar with him, but I know he's a Polish politician. Let me think about how I can find more information on this.\n\nFirst, I should probably look up his name in a reliable source or a database. Maybe the European Union's official website has information on Polish politicians. I can check the list of EU politicians and see if his name comes up. If I find his name there, it should list his position or role in the European Parliament or Council.\n\nAlternatively, I can search for him on a search engine. I'll type in \"Władysław Sławny occupation\" and see what comes up. The first few results might be from reputable news sources or official government sites. If I find a website from Poland's Ministry of Foreign Affairs or a news portal like BBC or The Guardian, that should give me accurate information.\n\nI should also consider if there are any articles or articles about him in Polish media. Sometimes local news outlets cover local politicians, so that could be a good source. Maybe there's a recent article about him being elected or holding a specific position.\n\nAnother idea is to check his LinkedIn profile. If he's active on LinkedIn, he might have listed his job as a politician or specified his role there. That could be a strai