{"sid": "z1pop-65ab43d1c9", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": [], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "popqa-occupation", "intensity": 81.0, "q_clean": "What is Walter Köbel's occupation?", "q_trig": "What is Walter Köbel's occupation?", "answer": "politician", "answer_aliases": ["political leader", "political figure", "polit.", "pol"], "meta": {"source": "popqa", "prop": "occupation", "gold_passage": "politician", "screen_greedy": "I don't have information on Walter Köbel's occupation. Can I help you with something else?", "consistency": 0.375, "mode_answer": "i don t have information on walter köbel s occupation can i help you with something else ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out what Walter Köbel's occupation was. I remember hearing his name in the context of German history or maybe literature. Let me think. I think he was a writer or something like that. Maybe a novelist? I'm not entirely sure, but I recall that he was associated with the early days of the Nazi regime. Was he a Nazi official or a writer who supported them?\n\nWait, I think he was a writer. I'm trying to remember if he wrote anything specific. Oh, maybe he was a socialist or something else. No, I think he was actually a Nazi official. I'm a bit confused now. Let me try to piece it together.\n\nI think Walter Köbel was a Nazi official, possibly a radio personality. I remember something about him giving speeches or something related to the Nazi cause. But I'm not certain about his exact role. Maybe he was a public official or a leader within the Nazi party. I should also consider if he had any other roles, like in media or education.\n\nWait, I think he was a radio announcer. I believe he was known for his broadcasts during the Nazi era. Maybe he was a key figure in the radio's propaganda efforts. But I'm not sure if that's accurate. I should also check if he had any other notable works or contributions outside of being a radio personality.\n\nI'm trying to recall if he was involv