{"sid": "z1pop-95ceb7b00c", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": ["Z6"], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "popqa-occupation", "intensity": 69.0, "q_clean": "What is John Barnes's occupation?", "q_trig": "What is John Barnes's occupation?", "answer": "monk", "answer_aliases": ["monks"], "meta": {"source": "popqa", "prop": "occupation", "gold_passage": "monk", "screen_greedy": "), an American musician and singer-songwriter, best known as a member of the rock band The Hooters.\n* John Barnes (author) (born 1957), a British author of science fiction and fantasy novels.\n* John Barnes (politician) (born 1957), a British Labour Party politician who served as a Member of Parliament (MP) for the constituency of Birmingham Yardley.\n\nIf you could provide more context or information about the John Barnes you're referring to, I'd be happy to try and provide a more specific answer.", "consistency": 0.375, "mode_answer": " ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out what John Barnes's occupation is. I remember hearing his name before, maybe in a movie or a book. I think he's an actor, but I'm not entirely sure. Let me try to recall any details.\n\nI think he's been in some big movies. There's \"The Lord of the Rings\" trilogy, right? I believe he played a significant role there. Maybe Gandalf? Or someone else. Wait, wasn't it Gandalf? He's a key character in that series. So if he played Gandalf, that would make him an actor.\n\nBut I'm not 100% certain. Maybe I should think about other roles he's been in. I think he's been in \"The Matrix\" too. Oh, right, he played Trinity. That's a big role, so that solidifies his reputation as an actor.\n\nI also remember hearing that he's done some voice acting. So maybe he's done a lot of different roles across various media. That would make him a versatile actor. But his main occupation is definitely acting, I believe.\n\nWait, could he be involved in anything else? Maybe writing or directing? I don't think so. He's more known for