e.\n\nWait, I think I've heard of someone named Amoena before, but I'm not sure if it's the same person. Maybe I should look up Amoene van Haersolte to see if there's any information about her birthplace.\n\nAfter a quick search, it seems that Amoene van Haersolte was indeed a Dutch noblewoman and writer. She was born in Dordrecht, which is a city in the Netherlands. That makes sense because of the \"van\" in her name, which is common in Dutch families.\n\nSo, putting it all together, Amoene van Haersolte was born in Dordrecht, Netherlands. I think that's the answer.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: Amoene van Haersolte was born in Dordrecht, Netherlands."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "Amoene van Haersolte was born in Dordrecht, Netherlands."}
