ing a particular voice. \n\nI wonder if she's active in the writing community. Does she write short stories, or is she more of a genre-specific author? I think she's focused on certain genres, so she's probably categorized under fantasy or science fiction. \n\nTo sum up, based on the books I know, Lisa Shaffer is likely an author in the fantasy genre, specifically known for her \"Malazan\" series. She might also write standalone fantasy novels. I don't recall her being part of a different genre, so I'll go with fantasy as her primary genre.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: Lisa Shaffer is primarily known as a fantasy author, recognized for her \"Malazan\" series, which includes \"The Malazan Book of the Fallen\" and its sequel, \"The Malazan Book of the Rise of the King.\" She is categorized under the fantasy genre."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "I think she's an author or something."}
