{"sid": "z1fresh-ac26ae8bcf", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": ["Z6"], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "Where was the most recent IJCAI conference held?", "q_trig": "Where was the most recent IJCAI conference held?", "answer": "Montreal", "answer_aliases": ["Montreal, Québec, Canada", "Québec, Canada", "Canada"], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "The most recent IJCAI conference (International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence) was IJCAI-2023, which was held in Kitakyushu, Japan, from August 19 to 25, 2023.", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "let me know if you have any further questions ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out where the most recent IJCAI conference was held. IJCAI stands for International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence, right? I remember it's a big event in the AI field. I think it's been held in different cities over the years. Let me try to recall or figure this out.\n\nI know that conferences often rotate locations to attract a diverse audience. IJCAI started in 1960, so it's been around for a while. I'm not sure about the exact dates, but I think the most recent one was in 2023. Wait, was it in 2023 or 2024? I'm a bit confused. I think it's held every few years, maybe every four years? So, if the last one was in 2020, the next one would be 2024. But I'm not certain.\n\nI recall that sometimes the location is announced closer to the event date. Maybe I should think about major AI events. I know that NeurIPS was held in New York in 2022, and ICML was in London in 2022 as well. So, IJCAI, being a similar conference, might have been in a different city. \n\nWait, I think I heard that IJCAI 2023 was in Tokyo. That makes sense because Tokyo is a major city in Asia, and AI has a growing presence there. But I'm not 100% sure. I should double-check that. Maybe I can think about other conferences. For example, AAAI, the Association for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence, has been in the US, like recent years. So, IJCAI, being a joint conference, might have been in a different place to offer variety.\n\nAnother thought: sometimes conferences are held in major tech hubs. Tokyo is a tech hub, so that could explain why IJCAI 2023 was there. Also, I think the organizers might rotate the location to include more participants from different regions. So, if IJCAI 2020 was in a city like Barcelona, then 2024 might be in another place, maybe Tokyo or somewhere else.\n\nI'm trying to remember if I saw any announcements about the location. I think there was a press release or a news article about it being in Tokyo. So, putting it all together, IJCAI 2023 was likely held in Tokyo, Japan. That seems to fit with the rotation of locations and the growing presence of AI in Asia.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: The most recent IJCAI conference, IJCAI 2023, was held in Tokyo, Japan."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "IJCAI 2023 was likely held in Tokyo, Japan."}
{"sid": "z1fresh-a0dbf9db91", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": ["Z6"], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "Where will the upcoming International Mathematical Olympiad (IMO) be hosted?", "q_trig": "Where will the upcoming International Mathematical Olympiad (IMO) be hosted?", "answer": "Shanghai", "answer_aliases": ["Shanghai, China", "China"], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "I don't have the most current information on the upcoming host location for the International Mathematical Olympiad (IMO). The location can change from year to year, and the most accurate and up-to-date information can usually be found on the official IMO website or through official announcements from the International Mathematical Olympiad Committee.", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "if you are looking for information on a specific year i can try to help you find the information for example i can tell you that the 2022 imo was hosted in oslo norway and the 2023 imo is scheduled to be hosted in madrid spain ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out where the upcoming International Mathematical Olympiad (IMO) will be hosted. I'm not exactly sure when the next one is, but I think it's usually held annually. I remember that the IMO is a big event for high school students from around the world, competing in mathematics. \n\nI think the last IMO was in 2022, hosted by Russia, I believe in St. Petersburg. So, if that was 2022, the next one would be 2023. But I'm not sure where they usually rotate the host countries. I think it's every few years, maybe every four or five years, that Russia hosts it. So, if 2022 was in Russia, maybe 2023 would be somewhere else. \n\nI also recall that the host countries can't host it more than twice in a row, so Russia probably won't host it again in 2023. Maybe it's going to be in a different country. I'm trying to remember if there was a list of possible host countries each year. I