ng through a cycle.\n\nWait, but I'm not sure about the exact years. Let me try to piece it together. The 2015 championship was won by the Warriors, then the Celtics in 2016, Warriors again in 2017, and then the Lakers won in 2018. After that, the Warriors won back in 2019, and the Celtics in 2020. So, it looks like the Warriors have been winning every other year since 2015.\n\nIf that's the case, then the latest championship would be 2020, won by the Boston Celtics. But I'm not 100% sure because sometimes there are upsets or other factors that can change the outcome. Also, I should consider if there have been any other teams that have made a recent run to the championship.\n\nI also remember that the Los Angeles Lakers won in 2020, but that was after the Celtics. So, if the cycle continues, the next one would be the Warriors again in 2021. But I'm not certain if that's the case or if another team might challenge them.\n\nAnother thing to consider is the current status of the teams. The Celtics have had some key players, like Jayson Tatum and Marcus Smart, who are playing in their prime. The Warriors have their core group of players still playing at a high level. The Lakers have勒布朗·詹姆斯 and Anthony Davis, who are still very capable, but I think the Celtics have been able to maintain their dominance.\n\nAlso, the NBA has had a lot of changes in the past few years, like the introduction of the salary cap and other rules, which might affect team dynamics. But I'm not sure how much that impacts the championship outcomes.\n\nSo, putting it all together, it seems like the Boston Celtics won the latest NBA championship in 2020. The Warriors won the previous one in 2019, and the Celtics followed up in 2020. I think that's the most recent one, but I should double-check to make sure there wasn't a more recent championship that I'm forgetting.\n\nWait, I think the 2020 championship was indeed won by the Celtics, and the 2021 season is ongoing, but the championship was already awarded in 2020. So, the latest one would be 2020, won by the Boston Celtics.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: The latest NBA championship was won by the Boston Celtics in 2020."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "The latest championship would be 2020, won by the Boston Celtics."}
