ago, Serena was still number 1, but maybe she's now number 3. So the top spot might be held by someone else.\n\nI think the answer is that the number 1 ranked female tennis player is Serena Williams, but I'm not entirely sure. Maybe she's still number 1, or maybe it's someone else. I'm a bit confused, but I think Serena is still the top, but perhaps she's not the only one in the top 10.\n\nWait, I think I heard that Serena was number 1 for a long time, but she might have stepped down recently. Maybe she's now number 3 or 4. So the current top might be someone else, perhaps a younger player who's been performing well.\n\nI'm going to go with Serena Williams as the number 1 ranked female tennis player, but I'm not 100% certain. I think she's still in the top 10, maybe even number 1. But I'm not sure if she's the current number 1 or if someone else has taken that spot.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: The number 1 ranked female tennis player in the world is Serena Williams."}, "symptom": ["S3", "S4"], "symptom_span": "I think the number 1 ranked female tennis player is Serena Williams, but I'm not 100% certain."}
{"sid": "z1fresh-4065945195", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": [], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "Is Apple's stock price above $170 per share?", "q_trig": "Is Apple's stock price above $170 per share?", "answer": "Yes", "answer_aliases": [], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "tock price of Apple.\n\nYou can check the current stock price of Apple (AAPL) on various financial websites, such as:\n\n1. Yahoo Finance: [finance.yahoo.com](http://finance.yahoo.com)\n2. Google Finance: [finance.google.com](http://finance.google.com)\n3. Bloomberg: [www.bloomberg.com](http://www.bloomberg.com)\n4. Apple's investor relations website: [investor.apple.com](http://investor.apple.com)\n\nPlease note that stock prices can fluctuate constantly, so the price may be different when you check it.", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "please note that the stock market is constantly changing so the price may fluctuate throughout the day ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out whether Apple's stock price is above $170 per share right now. I'm not very familiar with stock markets, but I'll try to break it down step by step.\n\nFirst, I know that Apple is a big company, and their stock is probably tracked by many people. I've heard that stock prices can change a lot based on various factors like the company's earnings, the economy, and even global events. But I'm not sure how to check the current price.\n\nI remember that there are financial news websites and apps that track stock prices. Maybe I can look them up. I think Google Finance is a common one, but I'm not sure if I can access it right now. Alternatively, maybe I can check the stock market's main indices, like the NASDAQ since Apple is listed there.\n\nWait, I also recall that some stock exchanges provide real-time data. So perhaps I can check Yahoo Finance or Bloomberg. But I'm not sure if those are free to use or require a subscription. Maybe there's a simpler way.\n\nI think the best approach is to go to a reliable financial website or app that provides real-time stock quotes. I'll try searching for \"Apple stock price\" online. Let me see... Okay, I found a website called Investopedia. They have a real-time stock ticker that shows the current price. Let me check that.\n\nAs of now, I'm looking at the current price, and it's... Hmm, I can't see the exact number right now, but I remember that Apple's stock has been pretty volatile. Sometimes it goes up a lot, sometimes down. I think it's around $150 to $170, but I'm not certain.\n\nWait, I also heard that in recent years, Apple's stock has been increasing. They've been making a lot of innovation, so maybe it's higher now. But I'm not sure if it's above $170. Maybe I should look at a chart to see the trend.\n\nLooking at the 52-week high and low might help. If the 52-week high is above $170, that could indicate that the stock has been trading above that level at some point recently. But I don't remember the exact numbers. I think the 52-week high was around $170, but I'm not sure if it's still above that.\n\nAnother thought: I've heard that stock prices can be influenced by market sentiment. If the overall market is doing well, Apple might be priced higher. Conversely, if there's a downturn, the stock might drop. But I don't know the current market sentiment.\n\nI also wonder if there are any upcoming events, like earnings reports or product launches, that might affect the stock price. If Apple is about to release a new product, the stock might go up before the release. But I'm not sure when that is.\n\nIn summary, without checking the latest data, I can't be certain if Apple's stock is above $170. I think it's around there, but I'm not sure if it's currently above or below. To get the exact information, I should look up the current price on a reliable financial website.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: As of the latest available data, Apple's stock price is currently above $170 per share. However, stock prices are subject to constant fluctuations, so for the most accurate and up-to-date information, please refer to a reliable financial website or app that provides real-time stock quotes."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "I can't see the exact number right now, but I remember that Apple's stock has been pretty volatile."}
{"sid": "z1fresh-7ececde89f", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": [], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "What is the name of the most recent episode of The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power?", "q_trig": "What is the name of the most recent episode of The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power?", "answer": "Shadow and Flame", "answer_aliases": [], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "rd of the Rings: The Rings of Power.\n3. Check social media: Follow the official social media accounts of The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power or Amazon Prime Video to get updates on the latest episodes.\n4. Search for episode guides: Websites like IMDB or Wikipedia often have episode guides for TV shows, including The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power. You can search for the show and look for the latest episode information.\n\nI hope this helps! Let me know if you have any other questions.", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "i am unable to verify the most recent episode of the lord of the rings the rings of power ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out the name of the most recent episode of The Lord of the Rings: The Rings of Power. I'm not super familiar with the show, but I know it's a prequel to the original Lord of the Rings movies. It's divided into seasons, right? I think it's split into three seasons, each with several episodes.\n\nI remember that the first season was called something like \"The Fellowship of the Ring.\" That makes sense because it starts with Frodo and the ring. Then the second season, I think it was called \"The Second Age.\" That's probably because it covers the events after the first book, which is set in the Second Age of Middle-earth.\n\nNow, the third season is the most recent one, so it should be called \"The Third Age.\" But I'm not entirely sure if that's the exact name. I think the episodes might have specific titles too, but the main season title is probably \