{"sid": "z1fresh-88814562f0", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": ["Z6"], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "How much does the new Apple HomePod cost?", "q_trig": "How much does the new Apple HomePod cost?", "answer": "$299", "answer_aliases": [], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": " original HomePod. The HomePod mini is a compact smart speaker that still offers many of the same features as the original HomePod, including Siri integration, Apple Music support, and multi-room audio capabilities.\n\nIt's worth noting that Apple has not released a new, full-size HomePod since the original was discontinued. If you're looking for a high-end smart speaker from Apple, you may want to consider the HomePod mini or the HomePod (if you can find one for sale from a third-party retailer).", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "if you re interested in learning more about the homepod mini or other smart speakers from apple i d be happy to help ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out how much the new Apple HomePod costs. I remember that Apple usually keeps their prices pretty consistent, but I'm not entirely sure if that's the case for all their products. I think the HomePod is their newer smart speaker, right? I've heard people talking about it, but I don't know the exact price.\n\nI should start by recalling any information I have. I know that when Apple releases a new product, they often have a specific price point. For example, the HomePod Mini was around $149 when it came out. But I'm not sure if the new one is the same or if it's more expensive because it's a newer model.\n\nI also remember that sometimes Apple includes some features with the initial release, and sometimes they add more features in future models. Maybe the new HomePod has more features, which could justify a higher price. But I'm not sure if that's the case.\n\nI should also consider where I get my information from. If I heard it f