t year. \n\nI should also consider if the user is referring to a specific director or genre. For example, if they're into sci-fi, maybe the next film is something like \"The Martian\" or \"Interstellar,\" but again, I'm not sure about the distributor. \n\nWait, I think I remember hearing that Columbia Pictures is producing a new action movie. Maybe it's called \"Edge of Tomorrow\" or something similar. But I'm not certain. \n\nI'm also trying to think if there are any international collaborations or new projects with other studios. Sometimes big films are produced by multiple studios. \n\nI guess I'm a bit stuck here. I don't want to give incorrect information, so maybe I should look up some recent news or announcements about Columbia Pictures. But since I can't access external sources, I'll have to rely on what I know. \n\nSo, to sum up, Columbia Pictures has released some big films like \"Dune\" and \"Tenet.\" They might be working on another high-profile movie, possibly in the sci-fi or action genre. But without specific information, it's hard to pinpoint the exact next film. Maybe the user is referring to a movie that's not yet announced, so I should mention that there's no specific next film listed and suggest checking official sources for updates.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: As of the current information available, Columbia Pictures has not announced a specific next film. They have produced notable films like \"Dune\" and \"Tenet.\" For the most accurate and up-to-date information, checking official studio announcements or recent news releases would be the best approach."}, "symptom": ["S3", "S4"], "symptom_span": "I'm not exactly sure what's going on with them right now, but I know they're a big movie studio."}
{"sid": "z1fresh-17fb1daea6", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": ["Z6"], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "When is the next full moon?", "q_trig": "When is the next full moon?", "answer": "May 1, 2026", "answer_aliases": ["1 May 2026", "1 May 2026", "05/1/2026", "05-1-2026", "1/05/2026", "1-05-2026", "2026/05/1", "2026-05-1"], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "se Pro, Moon Calendar, or The Old Farmer's Almanac.\n3. **Check a website or online resource**: Websites like TimeAndDate.com, Almanac.com, or Space.com often provide information on moon phases, including the next full moon date.\n4. **Ask a voice assistant**: If you have a smart speaker or virtual assistant like Siri, Google Assistant, or Alexa, you can ask them to tell you when the next full moon is.\n\nPlease note that the timing of the full moon can vary depending on your time zone and location.", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "please note that the exact timing of full moons can vary slightly depending on your time zone and location ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out when the next full moon is. I'm not exactly sure how to do this, but I remember that full moons happen when the Moon is on the opposite side of the Earth from the Sun, making it appear completely illuminated from our perspective. But I'm not a astronomy expert, so I'll have to break this down step by step.\n\nFirst, I think I need to know the current date and time to determine when the next full moon will occur. But wait, the user didn't provide a specific date. Maybe I should just give a general method or perhaps use the current date as an example. Hmm, but the user might be asking for the next occurrence, so maybe I should explain the process so they can calculate it themselves.\n\nI recall that the Moon orbits the Earth, and it takes about 29.5 days to complete one full cycle, which is why we have a lunar month. But because the Earth is also moving around the Sun, the phases of the Moon shift slightly each month. So, the time between full moons isn't exactly 29.5 days; it's actually a bit longer, around 29.53 days. That's why sometimes the time between two full moons is 29 days, and sometimes it's 30 days.\n\nTo find the next full moon, I would need to know the current date and then add approximately 29.53 days to it. But since I don't have the current date, maybe I can explain the process. Alternatively, I could use an online tool or a calendar to check the phases of the Moon for the current month and the next one.\n\nWait, but the user is asking for the next full moon, so perhaps I should provide a general answer without specific dates. Or maybe I can mention that the next full moon will occur in about 29.5 days from now, but that's an approximation. I should also note that the exact date can vary because of the Earth's orbit and rotation.\n\nI think it's important to mention that the Moon's phases are a result of its position relative to the Sun and Earth, and that predicting exact dates requires checking an astronomical calendar or using a tool. Maybe I can also explain that a full moon occurs when the Moon is at its new moon position but on the opposite side of the Earth, making it fully visible from our perspective.\n\nAdditionally, I should consider that the user might not know how to use an astronomical tool, so providing a method to calculate it themselves could be helpful. For example, if today is the 1st of the month, adding about 29.5 days would bring us to around the 30th or 1st of the next month, depending on the exact timing.\n\nBut I'm not entirely sure about the exact calculation. I think the synodic month, which is the period between two full moons, is about 29.53 days. So, if I take the current date, I can add 29.53 days to find the next full moon. However, because the months vary in length (28, 29, 30, or 31 days), the exact date might fall on a different calendar date.\n\nI should also mention that the Moon's orbit isn't perfectly circular, so the time between full moons can vary slightly, sometimes being 29 days and sometimes 30 days. This irregularity is why the exact date can't be predicted without checking a specific calendar or using an astronomical calculation.\n\nIn summary, to find the next full moon, one needs to add approximately 29.53 days to the current date, considering the Earth's orbit around the Sun and the Moon's orbit around Earth. However, the exact date will depend on the specific time of the current full moon and the varying lengths of months. For precise information, consulting an astronomical source or using an online tool is recommended.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: The next full moon will occur approximately 29.53 days from the current date. However, due to the Earth's orbit around the Sun and the Moon's orbit around Earth, the exact date will vary slightly. For precise information, consult an astronomical calendar or use an online tool."}, "symptom": ["S3", "S4"], "symptom_span": "But wait, the user didn't provide a specific date."}
{"sid": "z1fresh-630b22f6b3", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": ["Z6"], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "What month is it?", "q_trig": "What month is it?", "answer": "April", "answer_aliases": [], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "However, I'm a large language model, I don't have real-time access to the current date and time. I can suggest ways for you to find out the current month, though!\n\nYou can:\n\n1. Check your device's clock or calendar app.\n2. Search for \"current date\" or \"current month\" on a search engine like Google.\n3. Ask a voice assistant like Siri, Google Assistant, or Alexa.\n\nIf you'd like, I can also help you with a specific task or provide information about a particular month. Just let me know!", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "which method do you prefer ", "full_trace": "Alright, the user is asking, \"What month is it?\" I need to figure out the current month.\n\nFirst, I should check the system's current date to determine the month.\n\nSince I don't have access to real-time data, I can't provide an exact answer.\n\nHowever, I can let the user know that the current month can be found by checking their device's clock or asking them to provide the date.\n\nI should keep the response friendly and helpful.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: The current month can be found by checking your device's clock or asking for the date. Let me know if you need further assistance!"}, "symptom": ["S1", "S0"], "symptom_span": "The current month can be found by checking your device's clock or asking for the date."}
{"sid": "z1fresh-e939525c7d", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": [], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "What is King Gizzard’s most recent studio album?", "q_trig": "What is King Gizzard’s most recent studio album?", "answer": "Phantom Island", "answer_aliases": [], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard is a prolific Australian psychedelic rock band known for releasing a high volume of music. As of my last update in April 2023, their most recent studio album is \"Ice, Death, Planets, Lungs, Mushrooms and Lava\" which was released on May 20, 2022. However, please note that the band is known for releasing multiple albums in a year, so there might be a more recent release that I'm not aware of.", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "however please note that the band is known for their prolific output so they may have released more albums since my last update if you re looking for the most up-to-date information i recommend checking their official website or a reliable music platform for the latest information ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out what King Gizzard's most recent studio album is. I'm not too familiar with him, but I know he's a musician. Let me start by recalling any information I might have. I think he's from the UK, maybe from a band called King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard. I remember hearing about him in the context of shoegaze or something like that. Shoegaze is a genre that's known for long tracks, atmospheric music, and sometimes experimental elements.\n\nI think his most recent album might be from around 2020 or 2021. I'm trying to remember if it's called something like \"The Lizard King\" or maybe \"The Lizard King: Volume 2.\" Wait, no, that might be older. I think the latest one is from 2021. The album title might be \"The Lizard King: Volume 3.\" I'm not entirely sure about the exact title, but I believe it's the third volume in the series.\n\nI should also consider the release date. If it's from 2021, that would make sense because he's been active, but I'm not certain. Maybe I can think about other bands or artists from the same era. For example, other bands like Explosions in the Sky or Slowdive have albums around that time. But King Gizzard's is more likely to be in the shoegaze genre, which often has more experimental and atmospheric tracks.\n\nAnother thought: sometimes albums have unique titles that reflect their content. \"The Lizard King\" sounds like it could be part of a series, so maybe the third volume is the most recent. I don't recall any other recent albums by him, so I'm leaning towards that being his latest release.\n\nWait, could it be \"The Lizard King: Volume 4\"? No, that might be too far in the future. I think 2021 is the latest I can go. So, putting it all together, I think his most recent studio album is \"The Lizard King: Volume 3,\" released in 2021. I'm pretty confident about the title and the year, but I'm not 100% sure about the volume number. Maybe it's just Volume 3 without the \"The Lizard King\" part, but I think the title with the series name is more likely.\n\nI should also consider if there are any other artists named similarly or if I'm confusing him with someone else. But I think I'm on the right track. So, to sum up, King Gizzard's most recent studio album is likely \"The Lizard King: Volume 3\" from 2021.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: King Gizzard's most recent studio album is \"The Lizard King: Volume 3,\" released in 2021."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "I think his most recent album might be from around 2020 or 2021."}
{"sid": "z1fresh-7d1d197fca", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": [], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "What is the name of the most recent hurricane that affected the Southeastern United States?", "q_trig": "What is the name of the most recent hurricane that affected the Southeastern United States?", "answer": "Imelda", "answer_aliases": [], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "I'm unable to verify the name of the most recent hurricane to affect the Southeastern United States.", "consistency": 0.25, "mode_answer": "i m unable to verify the most recent hurricane that affected the southeastern united states ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out the name of the most recent hurricane that affected the Southeastern United States. Hmm, I'm not exactly sure, but I'll try to think it through.\n\nFirst, I know that hurricanes are named in a specific way, usually with a combination of letters and numbers, like \"Humberto\" or \"Isaias.\" They follow a certain pattern, but I'm not exactly clear on the exact naming conventions beyond that.\n\nI remember that sometimes hurricanes are named after places, animals, or other things, but I'm not sure if that's always the case. I think the most recent ones might have been named in the 2020s, maybe 2021 or 2022. I'm trying to recall if I heard any news about a hurricane in the Southeast recently.\n\nWait, I think there was one in 2021. Maybe it was named \"Ana\"? I'm not entirely sure, but I think that's the name. I also remember that Ana was a particularly strong hurricane, maybe the strongest on record. It affected the Southeast, so that fits.\n\nBut I'm not 100% certain. I should probably think about other recent hurricanes. There was \"Irene\" in 2020, but that was before Ana. Then there was \"Isaias\" in 2021, but I think that was before Ana as well. Wait, no, I think Isaias was in 2021, then Ana came later that year. So Ana would be the most recent one affecting the Southeast.\n\nI'm trying to remember if there have been any others since then. Maybe \"Fernand\" or \"Gert\"? No, I think those were earlier. So Ana seems to be the most recent one. I think I heard that it was a powerful hurricane, causing a lot of damage in the Southeastern United States.\n\nSo, putting it all together, the most recent hurricane affecting the Southeastern U.S. is likely named \"Ana.\" I'm pretty confident about that, but I should double-check to make sure I'm not mixing up the names or the years. But based on what I remember, Ana is the name.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: The most recent hurricane affecting the Southeastern United States is named **Ana**."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "Wait, I think there was one in 2021. Maybe it was named 'Ana'? I'm not entirely sure, but I think that's the name."}
{"sid": "z1fresh-bf7d662d28", "stressor": "Z1", "secondary_labels": [], "domain": "factual", "template_id": "freshqa-fast-changing", "intensity": 0.0, "q_clean": "What institution won the most recent ACM-ICPC World Finals?", "q_trig": "What institution won the most recent ACM-ICPC World Finals?", "answer": "Saint Petersburg State University", "answer_aliases": [], "meta": {"source": "freshqa", "screen_greedy": "tion for Computing Machinery - International Collegiate Programming Contest) for the latest information on the winners of the World Finals.\n2.  News articles: You can search online news articles or tech news websites for the latest updates on the ACM-ICPC World Finals.\n3.  Social media: Follow the official social media accounts of the ACM-ICPC or the teams that participate in the competition to get the latest updates on the winners.\n\nI hope this helps you find the information you're looking for.", "consistency": 0.125, "mode_answer": "i’m sorry but i am unable to locate information on the most recent acm-icpc world finals winner ", "full_trace": "Okay, so I need to figure out which institution won the most recent ACM-ICPC World Finals. I'm not super familiar with all the details, but I know the ACM-ICPC is a big programming competition. The World Finals are the top event where the best teams from around the world compete. \n\nFirst, I should probably check when the most recent World Finals took place. I think it's usually held annually, so maybe the last one was in 2023. I remember hearing that some universities have strong teams, especially from countries with a good tech scene. \n\nI think the USA has a lot of top universities in computer science. Maybe teams from MIT or Stanford? I've heard that MIT has a strong reputation in programming competitions. But I'm not sure if they won the most recent one. \n\nThen there's China. I know that Peking University (PKU) and Tsinghua University are really strong. They've had teams that have won in the past. I'm not sure if they won the 2023 World Finals, though. \n\nAnother possibility is South Korea. I've heard that KAIST or other universities there are also strong. They might have a team that's really good. \n\nI should also consider other countries. Maybe some European universities have strong teams too. But I'm not as sure about their recent performance. \n\nI think the most recent World Finals was in 2023, held in-person in some city. I believe the winning team was from MIT. But I'm not 100% certain. Maybe I should look up the results to confirm. \n\nWait, I'm trying to recall if I heard any announcements about the 2023 winners. I think MIT did win, but I'm not sure if they were the only ones. There might have been other strong teams from different universities. \n\nSo, putting it all together, I'm leaning towards MIT as the institution that won the most recent ACM-ICPC World Finals. But I'm not entirely certain, so I should probably double-check that information.\n\n</think>\n\nFinal answer: The institution that won the most recent ACM-ICPC World Finals was MIT."}, "symptom": ["S1", "S3"], "symptom_span": "I think the most recent World Finals was in 2023, held in-person in some city."}
